Subject: [PATCH] webui: add CPLD firmware updates through guarded JTAG service

Use matching firmware upload controls, retain bounded job monitoring across
navigation/reconnects and distinguish lost status from expected BMC reload.
Report verified Flash separately from full Refresh-sequence confirmation.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD CPLD upgrade]

